  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "People in Varginha, a town in Brazil where a strange craft is said to have come down in 1996 and a living creature to have been captured, say the craft was shot down: someone fired on it, and it was already falling when it arrived. Italo Venturelli, a surgeon who counts himself a witness to the Varginha events, tells Michels this as something others saw, and points to a young local man named Carlos de Souza as the one who will tell it first-hand. If true, it would mean someone attacked the craft before it crashed."
